WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Change how the board looks.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.400
Colors, fonts, sizes and gaps can change
to fit the learner.

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.400
The words never move.

4
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.400
Board looks to choose from:
High contrast,

5
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.200
CVI,

6
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.400
Color-blind safe

7
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.000
and Dim.

8
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.800
Fonts to choose from:
Atkinson Hyperlegible,

9
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.400
Lexend and OpenDyslexic.

10
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.000
You can also pick larger labels
and wider gaps.

11
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.500
Change one thing at a time

12
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:45.800
and watch whether your child
finds the words more easily.

13
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:51.500
If you are not sure which look fits,
ask your child’s therapist or teacher.

14
00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:56.000
V.O.I.C.E. A free AAC app for children
who are new to AAC.
